### DISS-004 [BLOCKING] voice=gpt-5.5-pro
{"category":"error-handling","anchor":".claude/scripts/chart-ticket.sh:op_epic","anchor_type":"function","anchor_line":159,"scope":"diff","description":"Epic creation is considered complete only when the map document exists; there is no lookup for an epic created by an earlier interrupted attempt.","failure_mode":"If br create succeeds and document creation subsequently fails or the process is interrupted, retrying creates another map epic. The original epic remains orphaned, violating the helper's stated retry and idempotency contract.","suggested_fix":"Give the epic a stable lookup identity and reuse it before creating another one, then finish the missing document write on retry.","anchor_status":"valid","anchor_stability":"symbol","answered_by":"codex-headless"}

